  ('zcrm_5797994000003668919', 'Clean Crop Technologies', 'Clean Crop Technologies', 'Joshua Kuteesa', 'Daniel Cavanaugh', 'Developer of a novel cold plasma technology designed to improve crop yields and reduce food waste. The company offers an energy-efficient treatment that uses only air and electricity as inputs, effective on a wide range of pathogens, toxins, molds, and yeasts, and leaves behind no residues or harmful byproducts, enabling farmers to reduce crop loss and improve food safety.', 'HV Genesis', 'Sustainability', 'Spring 2026', 'PitchBook', 'Reached Out', 'Joshua Kuteesa', 'Source', 'Sustainability', NULL, NULL, '2026-02-05 12:47:41', '2026-02-05 12:47:41', '2026-02-05 12:47:41'),
  ('zcrm_5797994000003668954', 'Nano Yield', 'Nano Yield', 'Joshua Kuteesa', 'Clark Bell', 'Developer of nano liquid technology for agriculture production designed to make fertilizer and crop nutrition specifically suited for the agriculture industry. The company''s fertilizer technology delivers cellular access to the plant, higher germination and vegetative establishment rate, soil nutrient rebuilding, and maximization and volume reduction of fertilization, enabling farmers to produce higher yields at low-cost inputs and less environmental impact.', 'HV Genesis', 'Sustainability', 'Spring 2026', 'PitchBook', 'Reached Out', 'Joshua Kuteesa', 'Source', 'Sustainability', NULL, NULL, '2026-02-05 13:06:28', '2026-02-05 13:06:29', '2026-02-05 13:06:29'),
