  ('zcrm_5797994000003685674', 'Interlune', 'Interlune', 'Sameul Alam', 'Rob Meyerson', 'Interlune develops and deploys systems that harvest natural resources from lunar soil, beginning with helium-3, and transports them back to Earth for commercial and government use. It designs and operates a multi-stage robotic harvesting process, excavating, sorting, extracting, and separating, with compact, energy-efficient equipment that candeploy in a single launch and operate autonomously with remote oversight. Through these systems, Interlune supports applications in quantum computing, national security, fusion energy, and medical imaging, while planning to expand into harvesting other lunar materials like industrial metals, rare earth elements, and water in support of a growing in-space economy.', 'HV Genesis', 'Sustainability', 'Spring 2026', NULL, 'Reached Out', 'Sam Alam', 'Rejected', 'Sustainability', 'Founder Communication (no response etc.)', 'Sam Alam', '2026-02-08 18:21:03', '2026-02-22 02:35:02', '2026-02-22 02:35:02'),
