  ('zcrm_5797994000003686089', 'Omni Instrument', 'Omni Instrument', 'Daniel Carreno', 'Raghav Jalan', 'Manufacturer of autonomous manufacturing tools intended to automate industrial assembly tasks. The company integrates motors, sensors, and structural design to create autonomous hardware capable of performing fastener recognition and classification tasks with low latency, edge computing capabilities, and embedded logic control, enabling manufacturers to enhance production efficiency and reduce human error in assembly processes.', 'HV STEM', 'Manufacturing Technology', 'Spring 2026', NULL, 'Reached Out', 'Daniel Carreno', 'Source', NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-02-09 11:52:38', '2026-02-09 11:52:38', NULL),
