  ('zcrm_5797994000003686141', 'Genabot', 'Genabot', 'Daniel Carreno', 'Jim Huang', 'Developer of advanced hardware and software platforms designed to enhance efficiency, yield, and quality in semiconductor manufacturing. The company offers AI-driven analytics, smart sensors, tailored support, and continuous innovation, enabling semiconductor manufacturers to optimize production processes, improve operational reliability, drive sustainable growth, and competitiveness.', 'HV STEM', 'Manufacturing Technology', 'Spring 2026', NULL, 'Reached Out', 'Daniel Carreno', 'Source', NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-02-09 12:27:12', '2026-02-09 12:27:12', NULL),
