  ('zcrm_5797994000003686299', 'Elementium', 'Elementium', 'Daniel Carreno', 'Matthew Dawson', 'Manufacturer of next-generation battery electrolyte system intended for improved energy storage. The company develops advanced electrolyte formulations based on MIT-licensed technology, intended to enhance battery performance by increasing cell stability, energy density and lifespan, higher operating voltages, and improved safety, enabling battery manufacturers to create more efficient, safe and long-lasting batteries for a variety of applications.', 'HV STEM', 'Manufacturing Technology', 'Spring 2026', 'Pitchbook', 'Reached Out', 'Daniel Carreno', 'Source', NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-02-09 13:03:14', '2026-02-09 13:03:14', NULL),
