  ('zcrm_5797994000003688138', 'Whistle Performance', 'Whistle Performance', 'Mia Dansby', 'Marc Kerrest', 'Developer of an AI-driven platform transforming the landscape of human performance by automating actionable insights from sports performance data. The company''s platform manages data and optimizes weekly practice planning by using machine learning, offering an advanced, user-friendly solution that integrates seamlessly into the workflows of sports organizations and predictive analytics to ensure players are match-fit, enabling teams to win more games by providing their players are match-fit and healthy, saving coaches and staff time while improving performance outcomes.', 'HV Genesis', 'Sports and Wellness', 'Spring 2026', NULL, 'Reached Out', 'Mia Dansby', 'Source', 'Sports & Wellness', NULL, NULL, '2026-02-07 13:37:37', '2026-02-07 13:37:37', '2026-02-07 13:37:37'),
  ('zcrm_5797994000003689034', 'beHuman', 'beHuman', 'Eashwar Krishna', 'Steve Yaskin', 'Developer of a tele-health platform intended for early cancer detection and preventive health screening services. The company offers a comprehensive suite of advanced cancer screenings, including genetic testing, blood-based biomarkers, in-home kits, and imaging, all delivered via a telehealth model, enabling clients to proactively manage their health and to detect potential cancer symptoms.', 'HV STEM', 'Healthcare', 'Spring 2026', 'Pitchbook', 'Reached Out', 'Eashwar Krishna', 'Source', NULL, 'Founder Communication (no response etc.)', NULL, '2026-02-07 06:08:15', '2026-02-15 06:26:39', '2026-02-15 06:26:39'),
  ('zcrm_5797994000003689070', 'Conexeu Sciences', 'Conexeu Sciences', 'Eashwar Krishna', 'David Bogart', 'Developer of a human collagen-based liquid extracellular matrix designed to promote tissue formation and accelerate healing. The company offers a thermosensitive scaffold that transitions from liquid to gel at body temperature, promoting cell migration, differentiation, and seamless integration into host tissue, enabling regenerative medicine applications and improving healing outcomes while reducing inflammation and scarring.', 'HV STEM', 'Healthcare', 'Spring 2026', 'Pitchbook', 'Reached Out', 'Eashwar Krishna', 'Source', NULL, 'Founder Communication (no response etc.)', NULL, '2026-02-07 06:20:36', '2026-02-15 06:26:30', '2026-02-15 06:26:30'),
  ('zcrm_5797994000003689096', 'Hinckley Medical', 'Hinckley Medical', 'Eashwar Krishna', 'Tristen Hazlett', 'Developer of a gurney scale and workflow protocol application designed to reduce pre-hospital medical errors. The company''s application can be attached to any existing ambulance gurneys to provide accurate patient weights in the field, ensuring accurate weight-based dosing and streamlined protocol adherence, enabling medical professionals to access the tools they need to improve patient care in the pre-hospital setting.', 'HV STEM', 'Healthcare', 'Spring 2026', 'Pitchbook', 'Reached Out', 'Eashwar Krishna', 'Source', NULL, 'Founder Not Interested', NULL, '2026-02-07 06:25:49', '2026-02-09 05:32:06', '2026-02-09 05:32:06'),
  ('zcrm_5797994000003689122', 'Oasys', 'Oasys', 'Eashwar Krishna', 'Hashem Abdou', 'Developer of an AI-native operating system for modern mental health, designed to help clinicians deliver more personalized and efficient care. The company''s platform combines an electronic health record and practice management suite with real-time data from wearables, genetics, and lifestyle sources, enabling therapists and clinics to access holistic patient insights and improve treatment outcomes.', 'HV STEM', 'Healthcare', 'Spring 2026', 'Pitchbook', 'Reached Out', 'Eashwar Krishna', 'Source', NULL, 'Founder Not Interested', NULL, '2026-02-07 06:37:51', '2026-02-09 05:30:56', '2026-02-09 05:30:56'),
  ('zcrm_5797994000003689148', 'Cellens', 'Cellens', 'Eashwar Krishna', 'Jean Pham', 'Developer of a cell surface scanning platform designed to assist oncologists in performing noninvasive detection of bladder cancer. The company''s platform leverages the power of atomic force microscopy imaging and machine learning modeling to perform tests that quantify physio-biomarkers on cell surfaces extracted from urine samples to provide a diagnostic score for bladder cancer, enabling oncologists, urologists, and healthcare providers to reduce invasive, costly, and inaccurate procedures of bladder cancer diagnostics to optimize patient survival experience.', 'HV STEM', 'Healthcare', 'Spring 2026', 'Pitchbook', 'Reached Out', 'Eashwar Krishna', 'Source', NULL, 'Founder Communication (no response etc.)', NULL, '2026-02-07 06:43:29', '2026-02-15 06:26:07', '2026-02-15 06:26:07'),
  ('zcrm_5797994000003689177', 'Agtools', 'Agtools', 'Joshua Kuteesa', 'Martha Montoya', 'Developer of a digital agribusiness platform designed for operators to increase profitability. The company''s platform provides critical data to reduce food supply chain waste through timely decision-making through real-time agricultural market intelligence by integrating commodity prices, weather indexes, and market news, enabling farmers to get a value for their crops, improve collaboration, and operational efficiency.', 'HV Genesis', 'Sustainability', 'Spring 2026', 'PtichBook', 'Reached Out', 'Joshua Kuteesa', 'Source', 'Sustainability', NULL, NULL, '2026-02-07 16:51:43', '2026-02-07 16:51:43', '2026-02-07 16:51:43'),
  ('zcrm_5797994000003689226', 'WiNK Therapeutics', 'WiNK Therapeutics', 'Madhav Jami', 'Warren Marcus', 'Developer of a modified RNA aptamer designed to transform the treatment of diabetes and solid tumors. The company offers a proprietary RNA aptamer technology with precise targeting of disease mechanisms, enabling patients with autoimmune and oncologic conditions to achieve improved therapeutic outcomes and durable disease control.', 'HV STEM', 'Healthcare', 'Spring 2026', NULL, 'Reached Out', 'Madhav Jami', 'Rejected', NULL, 'Vertical/Thesis Fit', NULL, '2026-02-08 08:47:42', '2026-02-12 12:04:38', '2026-02-12 12:04:38'),
  ('zcrm_5797994000003689252', 'neuropacs', 'neuropacs', 'Madhav Jami', 'David Vaillancourt', 'Developer of an AI-based imaging software suite designed to detect, analyze, and measure changes associated with neurodegenerative diseases. The company''s platform offers imaging analysis tools, proprietary algorithms, and compatibility with existing imaging workflows, enabling clinicians and clinical researchers to support diagnosis and evaluate disease progression in research and clinical settings.', 'HV STEM', 'Healthcare', 'Spring 2026', NULL, 'Reached Out', 'Madhav Jami', 'Source', NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-02-08 08:57:03', '2026-02-08 08:57:03', NULL),
  ('zcrm_5797994000003689278', 'Xella Health', 'Xella Health', 'Madhav Jami', 'Kelly Lacob', 'Developer of at-home diagnostic testing designed for early detection and monitoring of women''s reproductive health conditions. The company''s platform uses AI-powered analysis of menstrual fluid collected via tampon to evaluate molecular data across genomics, epigenomics, transcriptomics, proteomics, metabolomics, and exposomics, enabling individuals and clinicians to access personalized health insights, reduce diagnostic delays for conditions like endometriosis, and assess reproductive aging with accuracy and convenience.', 'HV STEM', 'Healthcare', 'Spring 2026', NULL, 'Reached Out', 'Madhav Jami', 'Source', NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-02-08 09:09:42', '2026-02-08 09:09:42', NULL),
  ('zcrm_5797994000003689304', 'CareLumi', 'CareLumi', 'Madhav Jami', 'Shai Basys', 'Developer of a compliance platform designed to streamline administrative and regulatory workflows for healthcare organizations. The company''s platform offers automated credentialing, payer enrollment, centralized provider information, tracking, reminders, integrations, and analytics, enabling healthcare providers and operations teams to reduce manual work, accelerate clinician onboarding, and maintain alignment with insurer and regulatory requireme.', 'HV STEM', 'Healthcare', 'Spring 2026', NULL, 'Reached Out', 'Madhav Jami', 'Quick Screen', NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-02-08 09:15:44', '2026-03-08 16:58:51', '2026-03-08 16:58:51'),
  ('zcrm_5797994000003689330', 'ChronicleBio', 'ChronicleBio', 'Madhav Jami', 'Rohit Gupta', 'Developer of a decentralized research ecosystem designed to advance the understanding and treatment of complex neuroimmune disorders. The company''s data-driven healthcare platform offers a comprehensive platform that integrates multi-omic data, real-time symptom tracking, and a secure biobank, enabling researchers and clinicians to create personalized diagnostics and therapeutic strategies to help diagnose and treat patients with chronic illnesses.', 'HV STEM', 'Healthcare', 'Spring 2026', NULL, 'Reached Out', 'Madhav Jami', 'Source', NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-02-08 09:21:47', '2026-02-08 09:43:47', '2026-02-08 09:43:47'),
  ('zcrm_5797994000003689362', 'VibeBrux', 'VibeBrux', 'Madhav Jami', 'Alec Miller', 'Developer and manufacturer of a biofeedback-enabled night guard system designed to monitor and manage bruxism, sleep apnea, and nighttime vital signs. The company offers an all-in-one device that tracks grinding activity, apnea patterns, and physiological indicators through an integrated real-time application that can be shared with healthcare providers, enabling individuals to protect their teeth, address clenching and grinding behaviors, and manage the negative effects of bruxism.', 'HV STEM', 'Healthcare', 'Spring 2026', NULL, 'Reached Out', 'Madhav Jami', 'Source', NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-02-08 09:56:00', '2026-02-08 09:56:00', NULL),
  ('zcrm_5797994000003689394', 'TAB Diagnostics', 'TAB Diagnostics', 'Madhav Jami', 'Troy Barring', 'Developer of a saliva-based diagnostic platform intended to support noninvasive metabolic health and wellness monitoring. The company offers graphene field-effect transistor biosensor technology that detects glycated albumin and other biomarkers from saliva and can expand to cardiovascular, stress, and inflammation markers, enabling healthcare providers and wellness programs to conduct rapid screening without blood draws and improve early detection and patient engagement.', 'HV STEM', 'Healthcare', 'Spring 2026', NULL, 'Reached Out', 'Madhav Jami', 'Connect', NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-02-08 10:06:14', '2026-02-20 06:25:07', '2026-02-20 06:25:07'),
