  ('zcrm_5797994000003694243', 'Array Labs', 'Array Labs', 'Soham Shah', 'Andrew Peterson', 'Developer of a remote sensing technology designed to create a real-time, high-resolution three-dimensional model of the Earth. The company uses clusters of satellites to image the same place on the earth at the same time can improve image quality over conventional techniques and increase the amount of affordable, high-quality data, enabling industries, including autonomy, defense, climate, environmental, and social governance, among others, a host of new applications and data research material.', 'HV Genesis', 'Financial Innovation', 'Spring 2026', 'Pitchbook', 'Reached Out', 'Soham Shah', 'Source', 'Financial Innovation', NULL, NULL, '2026-02-08 12:32:57', '2026-02-08 12:32:57', '2026-02-08 12:32:57'),
