  ('zcrm_5797994000003710889', 'Givebacks', 'Givebacks', 'Markos Papakosmas', 'William Bowen', 'Developer of membership management software designed to simplify nonprofit management and enhance fundraising.', 'HV Genesis', 'Financial Innovation', 'Spring 2026', 'Crunchbase', 'Reached Out', 'Markos Papakosmas', 'Source', 'Financial Innovation', NULL, NULL, '2026-02-17 05:12:24', '2026-02-17 05:12:25', '2026-02-17 05:12:25'),
  ('zcrm_5797994000003711027', 'Atraverse', 'Altraverse', 'Rosemary Moyo', 'Eric Sauer', 'Atraverse is a medical device company dedicated to developing a next-generation toolset for the $1B+ left-heart access market – a broad category of minimally invasive interventions including over 1M annual electrophysiology and structural heart patient procedures. The company’s first product is an innovative transseptal crossing system designed to improve patient outcomes, lower the cost of care, and address clinical workflow inefficiencies.', 'HV STEM', 'Healthcare', 'Spring 2026', NULL, 'Reached Out', 'Rosemary Moyo', 'Source', NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-02-11 00:09:21', '2026-02-11 00:09:21', NULL),
  ('zcrm_5797994000003711053', 'Inceptive', 'Inceptive', 'Rosemary Moyo', 'Jakob Uszkoreit', 'We build models of life beyond human understanding. Our models extrapolate from data to design breakthrough biological medicines. When the data is insufficient, we build experiments to create it, at unprecedented scale.', 'HV STEM', 'Healthcare', 'Spring 2026', NULL, 'Reached Out', 'Rosemary Moyo', 'Source', NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-02-11 00:19:52', '2026-02-11 00:19:52', NULL),
  ('zcrm_5797994000003711079', 'Lucence Health', 'Lucence Health', 'Rosemary Moyo', 'Min-Han Tan', 'LiquidHALLMARK® by Lucence is an ultra-sensitive liquid biopsy test that analyzes ctDNA and ctRNA to enable tailored treatment decisions. Speak to your healthcare provider to seek advice on your options.', 'HV STEM', 'Healthcare', 'Spring 2026', NULL, 'Reached Out', 'Rosemary Moyo', 'Source', NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-02-11 00:23:24', '2026-02-11 00:23:24', NULL),
  ('zcrm_5797994000003711105', 'DeepSight Technology', 'DeepSight Technology', 'Rosemary Moyo', 'Nader Sadrzadeh', 'DeepSight is transforming the landscape of interventional imaging.  Powered by our proprietary platforms — anchored by NeedleVue™ Technology* — we will provide real‑time, crystal‑clear visualization inside the body, showing both the target anatomy and the exact position of the instrument in relation to it.  From biopsies and ablations to advanced cardiac interventions, DeepSight aims to equip physicians with the precision, efficiency, and control to perform at the highest level — establishing a new standard for image‑guided care.', 'HV STEM', 'Healthcare', 'Spring 2026', NULL, 'Reached Out', 'Rosemary Moyo', 'Source', NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-02-11 00:27:00', '2026-02-11 00:27:00', NULL),
  ('zcrm_5797994000003711132', 'Watershed', 'Watershed Informatics', 'Rosemary Moyo', 'Jonathan Wang', 'Catalyzes discovery by democratizing access to bioinformatics tools for biologists.', 'HV STEM', 'Healthcare', 'Spring 2026', NULL, 'Reached Out', 'Rosemary Moyo', 'Source', NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-02-11 03:07:43', '2026-02-17 08:18:58', '2026-02-17 08:18:58'),
  ('zcrm_5797994000003711159', 'Rapid Nexus', 'Rapid Nexus', 'Rosemary Moyo', 'Margaret Kalmeta', 'Rapid Nexus Nanotech Wound Solutions, Inc. is a California-based medical device company developing regenerative technology that targets the root causes of chronic wounds. Its patented technology is the first to restore nerve function and circulation to prevent amputations and enable full recovery in patients with diabetes, trauma, and peripheral vascular disease.', 'HV STEM', 'Healthcare', 'Spring 2026', NULL, 'Reached Out', 'Rosemary Moyo', 'Source', NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-02-11 03:16:54', '2026-02-17 08:19:10', '2026-02-17 08:19:10'),
  ('zcrm_5797994000003711195', 'Biometry', 'Biometry', 'Rosemary Moyo', 'Bryan Nolan', 'Predictive asthma management through biomarker data and personalized insights. This innovative healthcare company empowers patients to proactively manage their asthma. They leverage patented sensor technology to measure airway inflammation via breath analysis, determining attack risk, medication adherence, and environmental trigger impact. Their app integrates clinical and environmental factors to identify symptom root causes, while their prediction engine builds personalized risk models. Actionable insights are delivered, enabling patients to lower attack risk and improve control. The company proactively engages patients with guideline-based coaching and education, promoting self-management at scale through CDC-recognized programs. This technology-driven approach reimagines asthma care, offering a data-driven, personalized solution for improved patient outcomes. This is a B2C healthcare solution.', 'HV STEM', 'Healthcare', 'Spring 2026', NULL, 'Reached Out', 'Rosemary Moyo', 'Source', NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-02-11 03:33:29', '2026-02-17 08:19:23', '2026-02-17 08:19:23'),
  ('zcrm_5797994000003711221', 'March Health', 'Delve Bio', 'Rosemary Moyo', 'Brad Murray', 'Delve Bio is on a mission to revolutionize infectious disease testing by bringing metagenomic (mNGS) testing out of the research lab and into the clinic. Founded by some of the world’s foremost experts in infectious disease, Delve Bio is ending the era of guess and test, enabling clinicians to test once and know.', 'HV STEM', 'Healthcare', 'Spring 2026', NULL, 'Reached Out', 'Rosemary Moyo', 'Connect', NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-02-11 03:42:05', '2026-02-24 20:13:31', '2026-02-24 20:13:31'),
