  ('zcrm_5797994000003712898', 'L-Charge', 'L-Charge', 'Riya Sabadra', 'Mark Jarvis', 'Operator of an EV charging company intended to design, manufacture, and operate scalable off-grid fast charging services. The company offers mobile and stationary chargers that use liquid natural gas to deliver a fast charging experience that guarantees less time and optimal convenience for electric vehicle drivers, enabling clients to revolutionize the EV charging landscape in support of global net zero and transition to an all-electric future.', 'HV STEM', 'Manufacturing Technology', 'Spring 2026', 'Pitchbook', 'Reached Out', 'Riya Sabadra', 'Source', NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-02-15 11:59:22', '2026-02-21 15:19:07', '2026-02-21 15:19:07'),
