  ('zcrm_5797994000003717140', 'Omius', 'Omius', 'Mia Dansby', 'Gustavo Cadena', 'Developer of cooling headgear intended to enhance performance and comfort in high temperatures to soak up the heat and keep the wearers'' bodies cool. The company''s wearables integrate robotics and artificial intelligence into garments that utilize evaporation technology to cool the skin, featuring thermally conductive materials that increase evaporative surface area, enabling athletes to maintain optimal body temperature during demanding activities and providing an advantage in hot conditions.', 'HV Genesis', 'Sports and Wellness', 'Spring 2026', NULL, 'Reached Out', 'Mia Dansby', 'Source', 'Sports & Wellness', NULL, NULL, '2026-02-14 18:11:51', '2026-02-14 18:11:51', '2026-02-14 18:11:51'),
