  ('zcrm_5797994000003717473', 'Beyond Health', 'Beyond Health', 'Zachary Christinat', 'Nicholas Change', 'Provider of integrated in-person and virtual healthcare services designed to reduce hospital and urgent care visits. The company offers a patient-first, team-based care model that combines clinic visits, digital care programs, and ongoing virtual support to deliver accessible, personalized, and comprehensive care for preventive health and chronic condition management, enabling patients to receive seamless, coordinated healthcare tailored to their individual needs.', 'HV STEM', 'Healthcare', 'Spring 2026', 'PitchBook', 'Reached Out', 'Zachary Christinat', 'Source', NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-02-15 12:50:00', '2026-02-16 12:28:45', '2026-02-16 12:28:45'),
  ('zcrm_5797994000003717526', 'Benchmark Health', 'Benchmark Health', 'Zachary Christinat', 'Thomas Insel MD', 'Operator of an AI-powered healthcare platform intended to transform mental health care through a precision-based approach to triage. The company offers to navigate the complex behavioral health landscape by connecting people to the right care at the right time while reducing barriers to engagement and follow-through, enabling individuals seeking mental health care and referring health professionals to achieve optimal patient outcomes.', 'HV STEM', 'Healthcare', 'Spring 2026', 'PitchBook', 'Reached Out', 'Zachary Christinat', 'Source', NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-02-15 16:41:51', '2026-02-16 12:30:43', '2026-02-16 12:30:43'),
