  ('zcrm_5797994000003717586', 'CoraVie Medical', 'CoraVie Medical', 'Zachary Christinat', 'Aimee Garza', 'Developer of an implantable continuous blood pressure monitoring device designed for early and accurate detection of dangerous fluctuations that lead to organ damage. The company''s device provides advanced notice of changing health status using end-to-end results seamlessly and remotely, which connects patients and clinicians through a cloud-based software and analytics platform, enabling timely, cost-effective clinical interventions to intercept and possibly prevent a hypertension crisis.', 'HV STEM', 'Healthcare', 'Spring 2026', 'PitchBook', 'Reached Out', 'Zachary Christinat', 'Source', NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-02-15 17:12:37', '2026-02-15 17:12:37', NULL),
  ('zcrm_5797994000003717612', 'PiroGon', 'PiroGon', 'Zachary Christinat', 'Rigu Gupta', 'Developer of a medical device designed to prevent aspiration of stomach contents into the lungs. The company offers a neuromodulation device that restores the natural function of the lower esophageal sphincter, enabling patients to reduce the risk of reflux-related complications, including pneumonia.', 'HV STEM', 'Healthcare', 'Spring 2026', 'PitchBook', 'Reached Out', 'Zachary Christinat', 'Source', NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-02-15 17:21:26', '2026-02-15 17:21:26', NULL),
  ('zcrm_5797994000003717639', 'CircumFix Solutions', 'CircumFix Solutions', 'Zachary Christinat', 'Louis Houff', 'Provider of implantable devices intended to facilitate optimal healing of musculoskeletal injuries. The company''s devices leverage natural processes and biomechanics inherent to bone by polyetheretherketone locking bands with detachable stainless-steel needles and a buttress plate, helping healthcare professionals to achieve reproducible and stable sternal fixation for patients to achieve a safe and reliable recovery with less pain.', 'HV STEM', 'Healthcare', 'Spring 2026', 'PitchBook', 'Have not Reached out', 'Zachary Christinat', 'Source', NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-02-15 18:35:59', '2026-02-15 18:35:59', NULL),
  ('zcrm_5797994000003717665', 'Prana Surgical', 'Prana Surgical', 'Zachary Christinat', 'Joanna Nathan', 'Developer of medical devices designed for minimally invasive surgery. The company''s device is a tissue-sparing advanced electrosurgical instrument that is used to capture small nodules in the lungs that are difficult to diagnose and uses bipolar radiofrequency energy to simultaneously cut and seal, enabling physicians to minimize the risk of complications during the surgery process.', 'HV STEM', 'Healthcare', 'Spring 2026', 'PitchBook', 'Have not Reached out', 'Zachary Christinat', 'Source', NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-02-15 18:45:32', '2026-02-15 18:45:32', NULL),
  ('zcrm_5797994000003717691', 'Origin Endoscopy', 'Origin Endoscopy', 'Zachary Christinat', 'Venkata Akshintala', 'Developer of endoscopy products designed to control gastrointestinal bleeding. The company specializes in diagnostics and reducing bleeding after a polyp procedure focusing on lower bowel and seal wounds, providing doctors with patient outcomes for procedures such as endoscopic mucosal or submucosal dissection.', 'HV STEM', 'Healthcare', 'Spring 2026', 'PitchBook', 'Reached Out', 'Zachary Christinat', 'Source', NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-02-15 18:53:00', '2026-02-15 18:53:00', NULL),
