  ('zcrm_5797994000003719172', 'Sealion Energy', 'Sealion Energy', 'Thomas Hoang', 'Reeja Jayan', 'Developer of battery electrode coatings designed to improve the durability and performance of lithium-ion cells. The company offers nanoscale conductive polymer layers that prevent particle cracking, enhance ion and electron transport, support high-temperature operation, and maintain capacity at elevated voltages, enabling battery manufacturers to extend cycle life and energy retention.', 'HV STEM', 'Manufacturing Technology', 'Spring 2026', NULL, 'Have not Reached out', 'Thomas (TJ) Hoang', 'Source', NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-02-15 20:30:45', '2026-02-15 21:08:21', '2026-02-15 21:08:21'),
  ('zcrm_5797994000003719198', 'Crossroads Solar', 'Crossroads Solar', 'Thomas Hoang', 'Patrick Regan', 'Manufacturer of solar panels intended to focus on social responsibility. The company features such as production of high-efficiency solar modules built to UL/IEC certification standards with performance and product warranties, multiple wattage options and panel configurations suitable for residential, commercial and specialty applications, a semi-automated assembly line with hands-on quality checks, and supply relationships with regional installers, enabling installers, system designers and renewable energy buyers to access domestically produced solar modules while incorporating workforce reintegration efforts into their procurement of photovoltaic components.', 'HV STEM', 'Manufacturing Technology', 'Spring 2026', NULL, 'Have not Reached out', 'Thomas (TJ) Hoang', 'Source', NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-02-15 20:45:57', '2026-02-15 21:08:05', '2026-02-15 21:08:05'),
